      "arabic_text": "كَفَى بِاللَّهِ وَكَيْلًا",
      "translations": {
        "en": "Sufficient is Allah as a Reckoner."
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "قَالَ اللَّهُ تَبَارَكَ وَتَعَالَى: ﴿إِنَّ اللَّهَ يُحَاسِبُ النَّاسَ بِالْعَدْلِ﴾",
      "translations": {
        "en": "Allah, the Blessed and Exalted, said: 'Indeed, Allah will make people account with justice.'"
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "وَقَالَ: ﴿وَلَا يَحْسَبَنَّ الَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا أَنَّمَا نُمْلِي لَهُمْ خَيْرٌ لِّأَنفُسِهِمْ إِنَّمَا نُمْلِي لَهُمْ لِيَزْدَادُوا إِثْمًا وَلَهُمْ عَذَابٌ مُّهِينٌ﴾",
      "translations": {
        "en": "And He said: 'Nor let those who disbelieve think that We granting them respite is good for their souls; We grant them respite only so that their sins may increase for them, and for them is a humiliating punishment.'"
      }
